{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05474","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 贺知章","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒憬尽怀忠，梯航已自通。\n九攻虽不战，五月尚持戎。\n遣戍徵周牒，恢边重汉功。\n选车命元宰，授律取文雄。\n胄出天弧上，谋成帝幄中。\n诏旗分夏物，专土锡唐弓。\n帐宿伊川右，钲传晋苑东。\n饔人藉蕡实，乐正理丝桐。\n岐陌涵余雨，离川照晚虹。\n恭闻咏方叔，千载舞皇风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺知章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}